OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on #10.5m Piccadilly
OL,4,AGardens revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a #10.5m
OL,7,Fredevelopment of Piccadilly Gardens in
OL,8,FManchester city centre.
OL,10,FThe scheme includes new trees, raised
OL,11,Fplanters, a children's play area and a
OL,12,Fspace for events.
OL,14,FManchester City Council also plans to
OL,15,Fimprove lighting and CCTV coverage in
OL,16,Fresponse to safety concerns.
OL,18,FThe work is expected to be completed in
OL,19,F2027 and forms part of a wider
OL,20,Fredevelopment of the area estimated to
OL,21,Fcost about #20m.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
